{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1576","id":4064991494,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87yStkG","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1576","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1576.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1576.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1576","number":1576,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[V1][P0][FRONT-01] Expose the learning-runtime product front door","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- register the existing `LearningSessionPage`, `TopicWorkspacePage`, and learning-runtime `ReviewQueuePage` in the application route factory/manifest\n- make the default student entry the fixture-backed Method Map route while retaining the existing PaperWorkspace compatibility routes\n- freeze canonical Method Map, Drill, session, and review routes in code and documentation\n- add a fail-closed posture adapter/UI for `accepted`, `provisional`, `blocked`, `visual-blocked`, `rights-blocked`, and the honest `ungoverned` fallback\n\nTracks #1564  \nParent: #1563\n\n## Canonical routes\n\n| Product action | Canonical route |\n| --- | --- |\n| Method Map | `/learn/workspace/:topicId` |\n| Start Drill | `/learn/session/new` |\n| Resume Drill | `/learn/session/:sessionId` |\n| Review queue | `/learn/review-queue` |\n\nThe root fixture entry is `/learn/workspace/topic-trig-equations`. Existing `/workspace/9709/p3/**` and `/review/**` routes remain intact as PaperWorkspace compatibility surfaces and are not silently redirected.\n\n## Dependencies / hold\n\nThis Draft PR is fixture-backed only.\n\nReal protected-route integration and production-like smoke are explicitly blocked until both dependencies merge and are read back from `origin/main`:\n\n- #1569 — API-01 canonical `/api/learning/**` convergence\n- #1571 — AUTH-01 custom-JWT root/protected-route integration\n\nThis PR does not copy or anticipate either unmerged implementation.\n\n## Posture and fallback behavior\n\nThe adapter only consumes explicit read-model posture fields. It never derives `accepted` or release truth from HTTP success, row presence, availability, scoring permission, or UI state. Conflicting fields fail closed with rights/visual/general blockers taking precedence. Missing or unknown posture renders an explicit governance-unavailable fallback.\n\n## Verification\n\n- targeted route/front-door/posture/session tests — 16 passed\n- route-manifest contract excluding one baseline-only stale placeholder assertion — 5 passed, 1 skipped\n- related view-model/route regression set — 55 passed\n- `npm run test:w6:learning-runtime` — 10 suites, 130 tests passed\n- explicit ESLint over all changed JS/JSX files — passed\n- `npm run build` — passed\n- `git diff --cached --check` — passed\n\nBaseline-only note: the full `src/routes/__tests__/route-manifest.test.js` currently has an unrelated pre-existing assertion requiring `AcademicProfilePage` to contain `RoutePlaceholder`, while current `origin/main` already contains the real profile page. This PR does not change that unrelated surface.\n\n## Boundaries\n\nThis work is outside Campaign A #1550. It performs no remote Supabase, Storage, Vector, or RAG writes; no PDF upload; no `question_bank` import; no public display; no provider/VLM call; and no source, rights, acceptance, or release-state mutation.","created_at":"2026-07-16T01:30:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T02:46:08Z","closed_at":"2026-07-16T02:46:08Z","merged_at":"2026-07-16T02:46:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"ff9e87f73ee5ba4a99ad6f305fa69ccef7cf0a46","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1576/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1576/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1576/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/d8cac865e5233378ae449dd7bff825fd14ee02d4","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/1564-learning-front-door","ref":"codex/1564-learning-front-door","sha":"d8cac865e5233378ae449dd7bff825fd14ee02d4","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/o